{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25906867488908129", "organization": {"id": "705560972632519", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "26105685972376587"}]}, "id": "931467836492809"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25906867488908129"}]}, "id": "1407423447840410"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25385691287757147"}]}, "id": "709017688708699"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "33007560172193177"}]}, "id": "1424967632310287"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25185006614419138"}]}, "id": "4265738553570088"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24552001997798976"}]}, "id": "1528611215220253"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24619062697733317"}]}, "id": "1256449906282392"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24334636456176019"}]}, "id": "1436794250889478"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "31112099521736814"}]}, "id": "720922214440907"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9804523692991003"}]}, "id": "1269522004586655"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "23868001389537044"}]}, "id": "2162380197599761"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "10017113878373725"}]}, "id": "1167765258406445"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "25906867488908129", "release_date": 1771386840, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26531459203115618"}, "id": "1214367866691639"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1773211406, "id": "26472846408976898", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v5", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 5, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26472869435641262"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "25906867488908129"}, "id": "26472869435641262", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "25906867488908129", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "853773924067888"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1559178898712444", "locale": "pl_PL", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I Am Crab", "keywords": ["Job", "Simulator", "Mission", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\udd80 Graj jako Krab\nWitamy w **Jestem Krabem**, chaotycznym, sandboksowym do\u015bwiadczeniu VR, w kt\u00f3rym nie grasz bohatera\u2026 jeste\u015b krabem. U\u017cywaj swoich d\u0142oni VR jako pot\u0119\u017cnych szczypiec, aby chwyta\u0107, podnosi\u0107, rzuca\u0107 i wchodzi\u0107 w interakcj\u0119 ze \u015bwiatem wok\u00f3\u0142 Ciebie.\n{1473427184562556}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Prawdziwa wolno\u015b\u0107 w sandboksowej grze\nOdkrywaj t\u0119tni\u0105c\u0105 \u017cyciem wysp\u0119 pla\u017cow\u0105 z pe\u0142n\u0105 swobod\u0105. Dotykaj, poruszaj i eksperymentuj z obiektami w pe\u0142ni sterowanymi fizyk\u0105 w interaktywnym placu zabaw VR. {1870410746934496}\n{1263170398567740}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 R\u00f3b, co chcesz\nPrze\u017cyj swoje najlepsze krabie \u017cycie \u2014 r\u00f3b zdj\u0119cia, organizuj imprezy taneczne, odkrywaj ukryte miejsca lub po prostu w\u0119druj po wyspie. Nie ma ogranicze\u0144 co do Twojej gry.\n{1934727460494145}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Pe\u0142na aktywno\u015bci\nWykonuj zabawne misje na pla\u017cy i mini-wyzwania rozsiane po ca\u0142ej wyspie. Ka\u017cde zadanie oferuje nowe interakcje i nieoczekiwane rezultaty.\n{1245044894484159}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Interakcja z pazurami oparta na fizyce\nDo\u015bwiadcz realistycznej mechaniki pazur\u00f3w VR opartej na fizyce. Ka\u017cde chwycenie, rzucenie i zderzenie wydaje si\u0119 naturalne, ci\u0119\u017ckie i satysfakcjonuj\u0105ce.\n{1234549054991911}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Denerwuj mieszka\u0144c\u00f3w wyspy\nSkradaj si\u0119, przerywaj czynno\u015bci i prowokuj zabawne reakcje postaci niezale\u017cnych (NPC). Dra\u017cnij, r\u00f3b psikusy i wywo\u0142uj k\u0142opoty \u2014 bo jeste\u015b krabem.\n{950422664309604}", "short_description": "I Am Crab to chaotyczne sandboxowe do\u015bwiadczenie VR, w kt\u00f3rym \u017cyjesz \u017cyciem psotnego kraba pla\u017cowego. U\u017cywaj opartych na fizyce szczypiec, aby chwyta\u0107, rzuca\u0107 i wchodzi\u0107 w interakcje ze wszystkim wok\u00f3\u0142 siebie. Eksploruj t\u0119tni\u0105c\u0105 \u017cyciem wysp\u0119, wykonuj zabawne mini-misje, denerwuj NPC-\u00f3w, rozpoczynaj imprezy taneczne i tw\u00f3rz przezabawny chaos w w pe\u0142ni interaktywnym placu zabaw VR, gdzie \u015bwiat reaguje na ka\u017cdy tw\u00f3j ruch."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1440_1440 (14).png", "id": "3978055615783071", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_3978055622449737_8122089896018969238_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F4ZGyo3GRG8Q7kNvwE8usqJ&_nc_oc=Adpstz31mHLoMb2eBq6cDbWp3oHBLzI4kwV65w3d01JXak01SKmMDfo3H7o4jhXag4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy895Xt3YW9Y5FapYLrbPKONgHkKBvFiEwIFmV-uqBLbw&oe=69CD23C9"}, {"file_name": "512_512 (8).png", "id": "1496836845162313", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1496836848495646_385973676460504382_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s6NlqxfguYoQ7kNvwFzqHkf&_nc_oc=Adr3z8I6-GO_L-uSV3xwk2fYWUjetSs1Hh9XirNyAjsg6Zd2ASs3TzSj0uHx-yXyNkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx6ozwiPQ0AzL1i0ZteCTrtY7ZuErm50exyyxhpTsG9og&oe=69CD1DE8"}, {"file_name": "1008_1440 (8).png", "id": "1413125936970467", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_1413125940303800_6289293856518061989_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jj0TU7IAv1EQ7kNvwEyaNgq&_nc_oc=AdoBeH7Z0AS0MiqV5AiPF8Tml2jIJSDD3_ZEvcquDLAGu2GuCULjAEXL_DwtRujarQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzEjXgc8MSJxV_lvHnBQkoCrW8uf0nFvjIO1GFfNlz_3w&oe=69CCFEA4"}, {"file_name": "2560_1440 (12).png", "id": "1345125720632628", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822813_1345125723965961_7736051124000975608_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lbM09jN-MKcQ7kNvwGTwUd9&_nc_oc=AdpfjliASguPIqw51Artyaf7IiMr7k0DfI1d8sz49FDQxmFg5Xd8QbXA3mFl7kpIVZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyYiaIj2SKB9e5gweZ6UAmki1asHfTP5moBPzBxu-MY5g&oe=69CD0873"}, {"file_name": "3000_900 (8).png", "id": "842714968563754", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_842714971897087_7981883553110623387_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P98FzCgHcM8Q7kNvwENlswh&_nc_oc=Adp_LFAZ1ewfNrFFtnueOVWJC8WJJJFrDulBdIy6MVlx2REbCROrQdIrWMKFLpfLpJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzmSJWNESjyeQ8i8jShVUF4wbZzuEC1Fy1fjcwaOE_bsg&oe=69CD02CA"}]}, "id": "1244982704486115", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Crab claw.png", "id": "4513948782172550", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_4513948785505883_7137350221975921502_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jBiQepR7a0Q7kNvwHdi4-R&_nc_oc=AdqjEZJLyX20CT5257vTh-GEWsrEdKJg8p5jlzRz1l8XdJ0Q_G90njQJsUS81AcgQqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx2r5Jz9ATcbQzJM5IEPwzeoFEl0qk9du3Tfv5XJLVHtA&oe=69CD0702"}, {"file_name": "Carb SS114.png", "id": "1889478978602822", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1889478988602821_6230537918678311012_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mH7FJzjdF4IQ7kNvwH1rnLp&_nc_oc=AdoyLAnvHfmYjlzloAhw5KcPd6MdJg_0F8SOvojuEwUemOCa_aftxdXTQDVBZ0AN8GY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwC5bNiauIBhSpR_g5H6QfSxBU6xTV2OQE89dYdza6UPg&oe=69CD1B11"}, {"file_name": "Carb SS13.png", "id": "4500320060199167", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_4500320063532500_533146387973958699_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FLAf0AKk66MQ7kNvwEwsNI6&_nc_oc=AdqbGhSuw_hrvzoiORY92eYsENqftuhHh1mciy9m-eC0HShVi0Wmfgy99kyzCUvKa3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afym3BLSBQkpwCvuUV9zxafLyVL2Z8AMhLvqTg2rAde-Cw&oe=69CCFD58"}, {"file_name": "Carb SS12.png", "id": "1435384034869141", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1435384038202474_5531164299316901953_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PDLud-K3EiMQ7kNvwFC-1tE&_nc_oc=AdqjSFu9nY-bh4O_MDycsd6uBRw5dBv6gK9H3ub1uLmnK-KdbNdAdiSGyk4gBpnApkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyOzG2p_DSm9qeZVl0rtURxEL55dXPuOv-vHz77wTddFg&oe=69CD28A3"}, {"file_name": "Carb SS.png", "id": "1238481665097026", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1238481671763692_2173012281129207439_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YIeF9BjC9JYQ7kNvwGFSfVs&_nc_oc=AdrvXpuV4NRm9AQz4wPhMSc9sZ9cxOpjl6pwze9J9Ham_pW3v4jzAl6ay9RIPxjhQXA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy8HEvIA8yYzzXh-HID8dWlnQ0oR_-ha33psdY1eTr80A&oe=69CD2482"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560_1440 (2).png", "id": "2053024175267627", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821782_2053024178600960_4697228775114001578_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q7rROBgkni0Q7kNvwEQ-kCR&_nc_oc=AdpPJ42j6MmWhKBLM2Gd2BI5-GuLfyX9Q71rVO5b8rNABOHPdKfeCZmyF7cS1pkRKs0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzCniXN0JvhiaN6o2A0_WLL-rFIsObzZ2rjOwVINHK0_w&oe=69CD1994"}, "display_name": "I Am Crab", "keywords": ["adventure", "Island", "mission", "simulator", "job"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\udd80 Play as a Crab\nWelcome to **I Am Crab** a chaotic sandbox VR experience where you don\u2019t play the hero\u2026 you are the crab. Use your VR hands as powerful claws to grab, lift, throw, and interact with the world around you.\n\n{1230119845972244}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 True Sandbox Freedom\nExplore a lively beach island with complete freedom. Touch, move, and experiment with fully physics-driven objects in an interactive VR playground.\n{1870410746934496}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Do Whatever You Want\nLive your best crab life \u2014 take photos, start dance parties, explore hidden spots, or just roam the island. There are no limits to how you play.\n{1233720542241584}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Create Fun Chaos\nKnock things over, mess with NPCs, and watch dynamic reactions unfold. The island responds to your actions \u2014 sometimes in hilarious ways.\n{1222883546720694}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Packed with Activities\nComplete fun beach missions and mini-challenges scattered across the island. Every task offers new interactions and unexpected outcomes.\n{2179752836166157}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Physics-Based Claw Interaction\nExperience realistic VR claw mechanics powered by physics. Every grab, throw, and collision feels natural, weighty, and satisfying.\n{1453155403184702}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Annoy the Islanders\nSneak up, interrupt activities, and provoke funny NPC reactions. Tease, prank, and stir up trouble \u2014 because you\u2019re a crab.\n\n{1392107025552767}", "short_description": "I Am Crab is a chaotic sandbox VR experience where you live the life of a mischievous beach crab. Use physics-based claws to grab, throw, and interact with everything around you. Explore a vibrant island, complete fun mini-missions, annoy NPCs, start dance parties, and create hilarious chaos in a fully interactive VR playground where the world reacts to your every move."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "947549941053842", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "I Am Crab", "keywords": ["Abenteuer", "Insel", "Mission", "Simulator", "Job"], "long_description": "# \ud83e\udd80 Spiele als Krabbe\nWillkommen bei **Ich bin die Krabbe**, einem chaotischen VR-Sandbox-Erlebnis, in dem du nicht der Held bist \u2026 du bist die Krabbe. Nutze deine VR-H\u00e4nde als m\u00e4chtige Scheren, um zu greifen, anzuheben, zu werfen und mit der Welt um dich herum zu interagieren.\n{1439006054584882}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Wahre Sandbox-Freiheit\nErkunde eine lebendige Strandinsel mit v\u00f6lliger Freiheit. Ber\u00fchre, bewege und experimentiere mit physikbasierten Objekten in einem interaktiven VR-Spielplatz.\n{762438906660106}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Mach, was du willst! \nLebe dein bestes Krabbenleben \u2013 mach Fotos, veranstalte Tanzpartys, erkunde versteckte Orte oder streife einfach \u00fcber die Insel. Dein Spielspa\u00df ist grenzenlos.\n{2128051881383844}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Sorge f\u00fcr lustiges Chaos!\n Wirf Dinge um, \u00e4rgere NPCs und erlebe dynamische Reaktionen. Die Insel reagiert auf deine Aktionen \u2013 manchmal auf urkomische Weise.\n{895501339913272}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Voller Aktivit\u00e4ten! \nSchlie\u00dfe lustige Strandmissionen und Mini-Herausforderungen ab, die \u00fcber die ganze Insel verteilt sind. Jede Aufgabe bietet neue Interaktionen und unerwartete Ergebnisse.\n{1450727716750998}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 Physikbasierte Greifer-Interaktion! \nErlebe realistische VR-Greifer-Mechanik, die auf Physik basiert. Jeder Griff, Wurf und Zusammensto\u00df f\u00fchlt sich nat\u00fcrlich, wuchtig und befriedigend an.\n{937928568598080}\n\n# \ud83e\udd80 \u00c4rgere die Inselbewohner\nSchleiche dich an, unterbrich ihre Aktivit\u00e4ten und provoziere lustige Reaktionen der NPCs. Necke sie, spiele ihnen Streiche und stifte Unruhe \u2013 denn du bist eine Krabbe.\n\n{2832876440397465}", "short_description": "I Am Crab ist ein chaotisches Sandbox-VR-Erlebnis, in dem du das Leben einer frechen Strandkrabbe lebst. Greife, wirf, erkunde und sorge f\u00fcr herrliches Chaos auf einer lebendigen Insel, auf der die Welt auf jede deiner Aktionen reagiert."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "2560_1440.png", "id": "4286198291638564", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_4286198298305230_542969112927964368_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nFHkFxkVezQQ7kNvwEN5HbA&_nc_oc=AdrcMIjqrEX_jJvygX4yWzWpLyOFAauvwxS29z3rWMFLDOcPGEbOQubfhlaVj_hwRfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfygB8lHRijWjq-N3zU0OsIkji5DLjxL0j4jsRD--fXbWQ&oe=69CD1FCB"}, {"file_name": "512_512.png", "id": "2379956029186698", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822897_2379956032520031_3847272232885182597_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tb06Z-Rf7oMQ7kNvwEGdddG&_nc_oc=AdpjGmjXEV_7IF_sx_YmgR1jQzUdJdzxFKqIV7IrJK-E4jfw1rMPQ-S43555D6gQDZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx0Fz2a7rHZTrnp6Cf5KChMOcgiFvKynkYK9neigyKm1Q&oe=69CD2CDA"}, {"file_name": "1440_1440.png", "id": "2086192821931302", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577